#24000
On the Ocean~
   It would be best not to spend too much time out here...stories abound of
adventurers journeying forth upon the ocean never to return. Given the size
of some of the waves that pass by, you have no doubt as to why that is.
~
240 0 7
D1
~
~
0 0 24001
D2
~
~
0 0 24020
S
#24001
On the Ocean~
   The blue water of the ocean stretches far to the horizon, making you lose
all sense of direction. You marvel at the schools of fish that streak through
the water, as though they were birds coasting in the air.
~
